    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kipuka Asalia Yudaya",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 11:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ŋinapei ayenunia Asalia ŋina arae toto a erwosit Aasia atemar aari lokoku keŋ, totub atemar toarae ŋituŋa daadaŋ ŋulu ke erwosit Aasia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 11:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nai abu Yeoseba nakoku a Yoram a erwosit, ŋina arae nakaato keŋ ka Aasia kinunaiya Yoas lokoku keŋ ka Aasia alokidiŋ ŋidwe ŋulu ke erwosit ŋulu acamitae akiar; kiwua Yeoseba iŋes ka aketen keŋ anagule ikotere Asalia nyear. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 11:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kiboiyoto Yoas ka aketen keŋ eŋopito alo kai ke Ekapolon ŋikaru ŋikanikapei ŋulu arakar Asalia epukat Yudaya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kios Yeoida ikoku Yoas kituruwo erwosit",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 11:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 11:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ani edolete ŋikaru a Yoas ŋikanikaarei, tonyarau Yeoida ŋolo arae esacaradoti ŋikarikok a ŋasigarya a ŋuna atyakatyakatae erae ŋamiae ka ŋasigarya ŋuna a lowae a ŋolo a ŋayona a ŋuna enyaritae Ŋaceris ta ŋasigarya ŋuna eteok erwosit, aponare Kai ka Akuj. Kiwuak iŋes acamunet kidiŋ keŋ ka ikes, kisikoŋ ikes alo Kai ka Akuj; kitoodiya nai ikes neni a Yoas a lokoku a erwosit. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 11:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kicikak iŋes ikes tema, “Ŋuna itemokino iyes kitiyata nu: ‘Iyes ŋulu ilosete akitiya etic akoloŋit ŋina a Sabato, totyakas ŋatyaketa ŋauni. Emaikina atyaket kus apei tolot akitere akai ŋina ke erwosit. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 11:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Emaikina atyaket ace min epuke ŋolo enyaritae Sur. Tolot atyaket ŋinace akitere epuke ŋolo eyai kaku ŋiketeok ŋuluce.’ Epite ŋol emaikina iyes toboonokinotor akitere akai ŋina a erwosit. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 11:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ani iyes ŋulu iyakasi natyaketa ŋunace ŋunaarei ŋuna sek ieŋununuyere akoloŋit ŋina a Sabato, itemokino iyes daadaŋ toloto Kai ka Akuj, kiteto erwosit. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 11:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Itemokino iyes kiwuakis erwosit kidiŋ kus, ŋinituŋanan totiŋite ŋiboro ŋulu ejiere; ituŋanan daadaŋ ŋini eapuuni neni kus, itemokino toarae. Kiteto erwosit aneni elosi a daadaŋ.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 11:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 11:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kitiyata ŋikapolokinitok ŋasigarya ŋuna atyakatyakatae a ŋamiae lopite ŋolo ecikitor Yeoida ŋolo arae esacaradoti ikes. Tonyarau ŋolokarikon ŋasigarya keŋ, yaut ŋulu alosete etic akoloŋit ŋina a Sabato ka ŋulu ieŋunito, potu neni a Yeoida a esacaradoti. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 11:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tokorak nai Yeoida ŋikarikok a ŋasigarya ŋakwaaras ka ŋaupala ŋuna sek arae ŋuna ke erwosit Daudi, ŋuna eŋadatae Kai ka Akuj. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 11:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tosodo ŋasigarya totaka ŋakwaaras kec iwuakinito erwosit kidiŋ kec alo Kai ka Akuj, kibaka ŋinapei alowae a ŋolo alo Kwap akitodol lowae ŋolo alo Kuju. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 11:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yau nai Yeoida esacaradoti, lokoku a erwosit kiŋa, kitanap ebokot, inak ŋakiro ŋuna ka acamunet aruwor erwosit, temasi ŋituŋa, “ Erae iŋes erwosit, ” Kedaut alimun kiosae Yoas a akimyet. Toramakis ŋituŋa ŋakan kec, tocelut temasi, “Ikigasi isua torubak erwosit eyari!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Atwanare ŋina ka Asalia",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 11:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 11:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ani iirari arwosit Asalia ecelet ŋolo a ŋasigarya ka ŋituŋa, abu iŋes tolot Kai ka Akuj neni aya ŋituŋa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 11:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ani edoli iŋes nen, kiŋolik erwosit ŋolo ariŋa eseunio ewoi alopir a ekek a Akai ka Akuj, lopite ŋolopei sek ewoenenea erwosit a nen. Erimokinito iŋes kidiŋ ŋikarikok a ŋasigarya ka ŋikakutak ŋarupepe, tocelas ŋituŋa daadaŋ elelyanete, tokusete ŋarupepe. Abu arwosit Asalia tocilicili ŋilowi keŋ, kiworou tema, “Erae ibore en aruruma ŋina demaret arwosit apukan, Erae ibore en aruruma ŋina demaret erwosit apukan!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 11:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kicik Yeoida ŋikarikok a ŋasigarya a ŋuna etyakatyakatae a ŋamiae tema, “Yautu iŋes kidiŋ ŋasigarya, toara ituŋanan daadaŋ ŋini iwarit aiun iŋes.” Arae ŋun anerae pa acamit Yeoida toarakinae Asalia Kai ka Akuj. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 11:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kikamut nai ikes iŋes apaki ŋina adolio lokidori ŋolo alomanaryata ŋaŋolei kai ke erwosit, ido toara ikes iŋes a nen.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 11:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 11:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abu Yeoida ŋolo arae esacaradoti kiwuak acamunet kidiŋ Ekapolon ke erwosit ta ŋituŋa, ikotere toruworos ikes ŋituŋa ke Ekapolon. Kiwuak daŋ acamunet kidiŋ erwosit ka ŋituŋa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 11:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Apotu ŋituŋa ŋulu ka akwap a ŋin daadaŋ tolomasi kai ka Akuj aŋina enyaritae Baal, toukosi Baal, tobwaŋabwaŋata ŋamuroeta keŋ ka ŋitorubei keŋ. Aponi Matan ŋolo arae esacaradoti a Baal, toarae alokiŋaren Ŋamuroeta. Tolimok Yeoida ŋasigarya akitere Akai ka Akuj. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 11:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tonyara iŋes ŋikarikok a ŋasigarya ka ŋulu anayona a ŋuna enyaritae Ŋaceri ta ŋasigarya ŋuna eteok kaapei ka ŋituŋa daadaŋ ŋulu ka akwap a ŋin, tosodi yaunae erwosit alo Kai ka Akuj, kitorunere lokek ŋolo aya ŋiketeok, ido yaarae kai ŋina ke erwosit, kisiboikinoe lokicoloŋ a ŋirwosi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 11:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tolelyana ŋituŋa ka akwap a ŋin daadaŋ, bu ekisil lotaun keari Asalia a ekileŋ a ŋolo alokai ke erwosit.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 11:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 11:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Arae ŋikaru a Yoas ŋikanikaarei apaki ŋina esyakinia akipuka.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
